{
  "answer": "The additional daily download volume for Landsat 8 can be estimated as follows: The difference in scenes per day between Landsat 8 and Landsat 7 is approximately 700 - 450 = 250 scenes/day. Given that each scene is approximately 950 MB in size, the additional daily download volume is 250 scenes/day * 950 MB/scene = 237,500 MB/day. Converting to decimal GB (1000 MB/GB), the additional daily download volume is 237,500 MB/day / 1000 MB/GB = 237.5 GB/day.",
  "citations": ["e1"]
